repository-code: "https://github.com/MohammadrezaNarimaniUCDavis/CreekFire_Snow_Persistence_GeoAI"
abstract: >-
  Public replication package for a multisource GeoAI study of post-fire snow
  persistence after the 2020 Creek Fire (Sierra Nevada, California), linking
  HLS NDSI persistence, Sentinel-2 burn severity, terrain, and ERA5-Land winter
  climate under matched BACI designs and spatially blocked machine learning.
keywords:
  - wildfire
  - snow persistence
  - Creek Fire
  - Sierra Nevada
  - GeoAI
  - BACI
  - HLS
  - burn severity
  - spatial cross-validation

